    "text": "How to Play CUNO in Under 3 MinutesCUNO is a casual tile laying game from Smidgen Games. Connect circles to score points and play strategically to keep your opponents from scoring big points. In this How to Play video, Ryan will give you everything you need to know to play your first game of CUNO. If you have any questions about the gameplay, be sure to ask in the comments below and we'll respond as soon as possible. Purchase a copy of CUNO from the Smidgen Games webstore today: https://www.playsmidgen.com/products/cuno",
